---
---
<section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="pricing-title">Free, and it stays free</h2>
      <p class="lede">ViewSwitcher is free and open source. No subscription, no seats, no watermark.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="plans">
      <article>
        <h3>ViewSwitcher for Mac</h3>
        <p class="price">Free</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The full set of views, in your colors</li>
          <li>As many shows and episodes as you like</li>
          <li>Your camera and screen placed for you in OBS</li>
          <li>Switch from the Mac, a browser or a phone</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>ViewSwitcher for iPad</h3>
        <p class="price">Coming to the App Store</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Switch views from an iPad beside you</li>
          <li>Plug it into the Mac with a cable: no Wi-Fi needed</li>
          <li>Works over your network when it's unplugged</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .plans { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) { .plans { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  article { border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 14px; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); display: grid; gap: 1rem; align-content: start; }
  .price { font: 700 clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; color: var(--ink-2); display: grid; gap: 0.4rem; }
</style>
